om/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119495","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119495","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119495.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119495.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-18T16:09:53Z"},"body":"Follow up to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111909 disabled the use of `--main-pack` for template builds to ensure only project files bundled with executable are loaded, which is absolutely the right thing to do for safety.\r\nIn Android however, the `--main-pack` argument can be used to point to `pck/zip` files that are bundled within the executable, and thus safe to load.\r\n\r\nThis PR restores this behavior on Android, while adding checks to ensure that the path provided by the `--main-pack` argument is contained within the executable (i.e: `assets` directory).\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119376\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url